// 006 - Devices reporting to Defender for Endpoint
// Purpose : Confirm which endpoints send telemetry, and when each was last seen.
// Source  : DeviceInfo (Defender XDR advanced hunting, Defender portal)
// MITRE   : Coverage check (supports detection of any endpoint technique)
// Tuning  : A device not seen for days has a sensor or power problem - a visibility gap.
// Note    : Defender tables use Timestamp; Sentinel tables use TimeGenerated.
DeviceInfo
| where Timestamp > ago(7d)
| summarize LastSeen = max(Timestamp) by DeviceName, OSPlatform
| sort by LastSeen desc
